---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../consts';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Cleaning by Cassi"
  description="Terms for using the Cleaning by Cassi website and requesting a cleaning quote."
>
  <article class="policy">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p>
      Last updated: <time datetime="2026-10-07">October 7, 2026</time>
    </p>
    <p>
      These terms describe use of cleaningbycassi.com and its quote request
      form. Arrangements for cleaning services are agreed directly with Cassi.
    </p>

    <h2>Website information and quote requests</h2>
    <p>
      The website describes cleaning services and provides a way to request a
      personalized quote. Submitting the form does not book a cleaning, reserve
      a date or commit you to purchase services. Your preferred date and time
      are requests; Cassi will confirm availability and arrangements directly.
    </p>
    <p>
      Published prices are starting points, as explained on the
      <a href="/pricing">Pricing page</a>. Your final quote depends on your
      home's size, condition, rooms and requested services. First-time cleanings
      and add-ons are quoted separately. Confirm the scope, price, schedule,
      payment and any cancellation arrangements with Cassi before service.
    </p>
    <p>
      A form confirmation acknowledges your quote request; it is not a booking
      confirmation. If you need to follow up, contact Cassi using the email
      address below.
    </p>

    <h2>Using the website responsibly</h2>
    <p>
      Provide accurate contact and property information, and share only
      information you are entitled to provide. Do not submit spam, impersonate
      someone else, send malicious content, attempt unauthorized access or
      bypass the site's security controls. Access may be limited to protect the
      website from abuse.
    </p>
    <p>
      Do not include passwords, alarm or door codes, payment details or other
      sensitive information in the quote form. Arrange any necessary property
      access directly with Cassi.
    </p>

    <h2>Your information and submissions</h2>
    <p>
      Your submitted details are used to prepare your quote and contact you
      about cleaning. You retain your rights in material you submit; a quote
      request does not transfer ownership of that material. The{' '}
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> explains how the form uses
      information and how to request a correction or deletion.
    </p>

    <h2>Website content and external links</h2>
    <p>
      Website content, branding and third-party material remain subject to their
      owners' rights and applicable licenses. Separately licensed code and
      assets remain governed by their respective licenses.
    </p>
    <p>
      External websites, including Facebook, have their own terms and privacy
      policies. Links do not guarantee the availability or suitability of those
      services.
    </p>

    <h2>Availability and your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Website information may be updated, contain errors or be temporarily
      unavailable. Please confirm service details directly with Cassi. Nothing
      in these website terms excludes rights or remedies that applicable law
      does not allow to be excluded.
    </p>

    <h2>Questions and updates</h2>
    <p>
      Contact <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> with
      questions about these terms or your quote. Updates will be posted here
      with a revised date. Changes to this page do not change an existing agreed
      cleaning arrangement.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="/quote">Back to the quote form</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .policy {
    max-width: 72ch;
    margin-inline: auto;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .policy h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
</style>
